          "question": "e-4387",
          "field": null,
          "attribute": "question/worked-solution",
          "value": "To find the transpose, we interchange the rows and columns. \n\nHere, there is just a single row, so it becomes a single column:\n\n$$\n{A}^T = \n    \t\t\\left\\lbrack\n    \t\t\\matrix {\n    5 \\ \n    -1 \\ \n    0 \\  \n    \t\t}\n    \t\t\\right\\rbrack\n$$",
