          "field": null,
          "attribute": "question/problem",
          "value": "Consider the matrix\n    ${B} = \n    \\left\\lbrack\n    \\matrix {\n        1 & 2 & 4 & 2\\\n        4 & 4 & 1 & 1\\\n        3 & -3 & 0 & -1\n    }\n    \\right\\rbrack.$\nWhat are the dimensions of ${B}^T?$",
