      "source": [
        {
          "question": "e-4388",
          "field": null,
          "attribute": "question/worked-solution",
          "value": "When a matrix is transposed, its dimensions switch from $N \\times M$ to $M \\times N.$\n\nSo, since $B$ is a $3 \\times 4$ matrix, the transpose ${B}^T$ is a $4\\times3$ matrix.",
